Z||000000||GT Bastard||05-08-2000||04:50 PM||||After a new battery, and new alternator, she still won't charge.  Belt is not slipping, it's snug.  Alternator is a rebuilt Delco/Remy 94 amp unit. Ground wire was checked and cleaned.  All connections are good(no corrosion.)  I even removed the alternator AGAIN yesterday and had it tested at Advanced Auto.  It usually sticks at about 8-10 volts for a few minutes and gradually dies.  Any ideas?||||reg||8
